      "liked": false,
      "collapsed": false,
      "text": " <p>The poster child for taking a joke too far. Much like an inside joke, I found it deeply unfunny and frustrating for a while, then it hit a breaking point about 10 minutes from the end where I was enjoying the joke again. I feel like this movie’s concept is referenced much more than the actual movie is discussed. Much like Captain Phillips, it has entered the zeitgeist while still being underwetched by the general public. It is an odd experience but if you want to shut your brain off for a while and watch a dead body do funny things, it's somewhat enjoyable.</p> ",
